        "body_raw": "Changeling."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "Your dark legacy manifests in one of the following ways. You choose the manifestation when you choose the feat, and once selected it cannot be changed. Hag Claws (Ex): You gain a +1 bonus on attack and damage rolls with your claws. Surprisingly Tough (Ex): Your natural armor bonus increases by +1. Uncanny Resistance (Su): You gain spell resistance equal to 6 + your character level."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Special",
        "body_raw": "You can gain this feat up to three times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, you must select a different manifestation."
      }
